<title>AUSTRIA: All OPEC ministers assembled for meeting.</title>
<headline>All OPEC ministers assembled for meeting.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>All OPEC oil minister were assembled for their full meeting at the OPEC Secretariat building on Thursday.</p>
<p>head of the Iraqi delegation Osama al-Hiti said he expected the opening session of the conference to deal with routine administrative business with the issue of production being left until Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
